        <span itemprop="definition">(a) poly(m-phenylene-isophthalamide); (b) solvent: NMP with CaCl 2 /LiCl; (c) a volatile second solvent: acetonitrile or THF. (d) ceramic particles (nano silica to improve the ionic conductivity; sub-micron/micron alumina to improve the thermal performance).</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0073">
